~ start


In the middle of the night, you hear a crunching noise coming from the fridge.
A rat chewed through your cable. What do you do?  

- Buy a new one
	You spend $200 on a replacement. Problem solved, but your wallet feels lighter...  
	do Global.player.decrement_gauge(200, "money")  

- Try to fix it myself
	if Global.player.player_intelligence >= 40  
		With your skills, you manage to repair the cable. Crisis averted!  
	else  
		Despite your best efforts, you only make things worse.  
		Now, the socket is damaged too...  
		You end up spending $400 to fix everything.  
		do Global.player.decrement_gauge(400, "money")  
		do Global.player.decrement_gauge(50, "energy")
=> END

~ start2


In the middle of the night, you hear a crunching noise coming from the fridge.
THE SAME RATE CHEWED THROUGH YOUR CABLE AGAIN. What do you do?  

- Buy a new one
	You spend $200 on a replacement. Problem solved, but your wallet feels lighter...  
	do Global.player.decrement_gauge(200, "money")  

- Try to fix it myself
	if Global.player.player_intelligence >= 60  
		With your skills, you manage to repair the cable. Crisis averted!  
	else  
		Despite your best efforts, you only make things worse.  
		Now, the socket is damaged too...  
		You end up spending $300 to fix everything.  
		do Global.player.decrement_gauge(400, "money")  
		do Global.player.decrement_gauge(50, "energy")

- Try to talk with the rat [if Global.player.player_moral < 50]
	me: "Hey, little guy. Could you... maybe stop chewing on my cable? I've had a rough day, and I really don’t need any more problems."
	The rat pauses for a moment, looks at you with its beady eyes, and then slowly continues chewing.
	me: "Honestly, I get it. Life’s tough. But still, I need that cable, you know? Can we talk about this?"
	You continue rambling, hoping the rat will at least listen to you.
	The rat stops chewing, seemingly listening. You talk about your day, your frustrations, and everything that’s been going wrong.
	Finally, the rat scurries off, leaving the cable untouched. You stare at it for a moment, unsure if that was some sort of miracle or just sheer luck.
	You don’t need to spend any money, but you feel strangely tired from the bizarre interaction.
	do Global.player.decrement_gauge(25, "energy")
	do Global.player.increment_gauge(20,"moral")
=> END

